 tanto para el segundo coche como para los invitados e incluso su propio restaurante con una agradebla terraza donde por tomar algo todos los dias del año. \nA 1 km de El Corte Inglés de Puerto Banús, cerca de un Mercadona para hacer la compra, junto a los mejores colegios tanto publicos como privados. Cerca de los mejores campos de golf, cerca de restaurantes y todos los servivios.\nSin lugar a dudas, una de las urbanizaciones más demanadas por la calidad de vida que te aportará.\nEste piso es una segunda planta en esquina, más ventanas para tener mas luz natural, menos vecinos por ser una esquina. Con vistas abierta. Con orientación sureste.\n3 dormitors y 2 baños, cocina con un lavadero y un amplio salón con acceso a una gran terraza acristalada para poder usarse incluso en invierno.\nUna gan ‌propiedad ‌tanto ‌si ‌quieres ‌vivir ‌todo el ‌año o ‌como segunda recidencia para disfrutar ‌de ‌tus ‌vacaciones.\nEn ‌el ‌precio se incluye una ‌plaza ‌de ‌garaje ‌privada ‌en ‌el ‌garaje","en":"A residential complex with 24-hour security, 2 spacious beach-style swimming pools, 4 padel courts, a children’s play area, extensive gardens with lush greenery, communal parking for both a second car and guests, and even its own restaurant with a lovely terrace where you can enjoy a drink every day of the year. \nJust 1 km from El Corte Inglés in Puerto Banús, close to a Mercadona for your shopping, and right next to the best state and private schools. Close to the finest golf courses, restaurants and all amenities.\nWithout a doubt, one of the most sought-after residential complexes thanks to the quality of life it offers.\nThis flat is a corner flat on the second floor, with more windows to let in plenty of natural light and fewer neighbours due to its corner location. It boasts unobstructed views and a south-east facing aspect.\nIt comprises 3 bedrooms and 2 bathrooms, a kitchen with a utility room, and a spacious living room opening onto a large glazed terrace that can be used even in winter.\nA great property ‌whether ‌you ‌want ‌to ‌live ‌here all ‌year round ‌or use it as a ‌second ‌home ‌to ‌enjoy ‌your holidays.\nThe price includes ‌a ‌private ‌parking ‌space ‌in ‌the ‌garage"},"features":{"es":["Cerca de Golf","Cerca de Puerto","Cerca de Tiendas","Cerca del Mar","Cerca de Ciudad","Cerca de Colegios","Urbanización","Este","Buen","Comunitaria","Piscina de Niños","Aire Acondicionado","Calefacción Central.","Terraza Cubierta","Ascensor","Armarios Empotrados","Cerca de Transporte","Terraza Privada","Paddle Tenis","Pista de Tenis","Lavadero","Baño En-Suite","Suelos de Mármol","Restaurant","Opcionales","Equipada","Comunitario","Recinto Cerrado","Seguridad 24 Horas","Electricidad","Agua Potable","Casas de vacaciónes","Inversion","Reducido","Reventa","Contemporáneo"],"en":["Close To Golf","Close To Port","Close To Shops","Close To Sea","Close To Town","Close To Schools","Urbanisation","East","Good","Communal","Children`s Pool","Air Conditioning","Central Heating","Covered Terrace","Lift","Fitted Wardrobes","Near Transport","Private Terrace","Paddle Tennis","Tennis Court","Utility Room","Ensuite Bathroom","Marble Flooring","Restaurant On Site","Optional","Fully Fitted","Communal","Gated Complex","24 Hour Security","Electricity","Drinkable Water","Holiday Homes","Investment","Reduced","Resale","Contemporary"]},"piscina":true,"parking":false,"jardin":true,"estado":"Available","gps":{},"energia":{"CO2Rated":"","CO2Value":"","EnergyRated":"","EnergyValue":"","Image":""},"gastos":{"comunidad":"0","ibi":"0","basura":"0"}}